{"text": "JEREMY WINE CO\u2019\n\nOLD VINE ZINFANDEL\nVINEYARD CUVEE | LODI APPELLATION\n\n2018 VINTAGE NOTES:\n\nOur\n\n8 Zinfandel Vineyard Cuve\u00e9 is a blend of some of our favorite\nId Vine Zinfandel 1g over 100 years of age. In 2018\n\n\u00bbse to pick our Zins riper and the resulting wines\n\nLodi\n\nfields a\n\nig, plush and\n\nsuper fruit forward, From these individual vineyard lots we choose the\n\nvery best barrels to bottle as viney\n\nnates, The remaining still\namazing and we blend these vineyards together to create a beautiful\n\nblended expression of Zinfandel\n\nTASTING NOTES:\n\nWe blended in a scant 5% Petite Sirah to further enhance the texture and\n\nmouthfeel of an already overflowingly juicy wine. Rich and bold on the\n\nlack cherry finishin\n\nnose, layered with ripe plum, blackberry jam and\n\nin soft, sweet spice and lightly toasty vanilla. On the palate, this\n\nZinfandel delivers a heav\n\night texture of soft, broad tannins that linger\n\nin a mix of blueberry, smoky dark chocolate and vanilla. Aged 16 months\n\nin American Oak barrels\n\nT\n\nINICAL DETAILS:\n\nVARIETAL: 95% Zinfar 5 sira\n\nVINTAGE:\n\nAPPELLATION Lodi\n\nALCOHOL:\n\nRS. 4\n\nPH 3.79 TA: 6.5",
